Package: oocron
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Pure systemd timer scheduler replacing legacy cron with journald integration in pure openOODA.
 Transpiles cron schedules into hardened systemd timer and service units with dual-surface CLI and MCP server.
